        "text": "The case challenges California\u2019s Proposition\u202f12, which bans the in\u2011state sale of pork that comes from pigs raised in confinement that does not allow them to lie down, stand up, fully extend their limbs, or turn around freely."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "0028ea4c79418459882785fe66f8b64eaf0c17a2a79ef532651101ebd2638187",
            "evidence_ids": [
