          ],
          "text": "According to National Pork Producers Council, petitioners rely on the Dormant Commerce Clause\u2019s negative command, arguing that states may not enforce regulations that affect interstate commerce when Congress has not legislated on the subject."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "National Pork Producers Council",
          "citations": [
            {
