              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 4,
                "start": 4
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to National Pork Producers Council, petitioners claim that prior cases (Baldwin, Brown\u2011Forman, Healy) suggest an \u201calmost per se\u201d rule against state laws with extraterritorial effects."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "United States",
          "citations": [
