              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 54,
                "start": 53
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to United States, petitioners argue that Proposition\u202f12 fails the Pike test because it imposes a substantial burden on interstate commerce without a legitimate local benefit."
